Description: elegant calendar for Linux
 Callie is a calendar for people who live in their calendar. It connects to
 Google Calendar and any CalDAV server, and gives you day, week, month and
 agenda views that are quick to read and quick to change.
 .
 A companion command-line interface is included for power users.
